<title>USA: Norwood buys back 526,700 shares.</title>
<headline>Norwood buys back 526,700 shares.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwood Promotional Products Inc said Tuesday it had repurchased 526,700 shares at an average price of $12.81 a share.</p>
<p>It said it made the purchase because it believes the shares are undervalued. It said it has no plans to buy additional shares.</p>
<p>Norwood supplies promotional products and has more than 2,000 items in its merchandise mix. Its products are sold by more than 11,000 distributors in the U.S. and international markets.</p>
</text>
